t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c242a42 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c242a42\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9037250 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9037250\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Co-Curricular-Excellence-qyd6cg6v6bg5t3tsfe9aip18z3gfy396gzupv5pqv4.png\" title=\"Co-Curricular Excellence\" alt=\"Co-Curricular Excellence\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-512ec78 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"512ec78\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea470ca e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ea470ca\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3725ed1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"3725ed1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_center   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Learning Enriched <span><span>With Values<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d63b2a1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d63b2a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe four Houses at Jaipuria Schools emphasize on holistic learning. Each house \ninculcates a set of diverse characteristics and values, and give platform to children to \nnurture their talents and showcase their abilities. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4960186 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4960186\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"765\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Houses.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-3806\" alt=\"Learning Enriched With Values\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Houses.png 1500w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Houses-300x153.png 300w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Houses-1024x522.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Houses-768x392.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f530663 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f530663\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd29c9c e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fd29c9c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c45551 elementor-position-top elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"4c45551\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"399\" height=\"418\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/gamechanger.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1953\" alt=\"game changer\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/gamechanger.png 399w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/gamechanger-286x300.png 286w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 399px) 100vw, 399px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Game Changers<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">You can easily spot them. For they always stand out from the crowd. Explorers, innovators, visionaries, problem solvers, they can turn challenges into opportunities and win any game.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b16a30 elementor-position-top elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"9b16a30\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"399\" height=\"418\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/tra.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1954\" alt=\"Trailblazers\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/tra.png 399w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/tra-286x300.png 286w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 399px) 100vw, 399px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Trailblazers<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">They know their journey to make their own road. They think new. They break new grounds. Effective leaders - they set the trends for others to follow.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ca610a elementor-position-top elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"5ca610a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"399\" height=\"418\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/go.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1962\" alt=\"Go-Getters\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/go.png 399w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/go-286x300.png 286w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 399px) 100vw, 399px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Go-Getters<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Energetic, enterprising, empowered - three words best describe the go-getters. Passionate about their work, they leave no stone unturned to achieve what they have set out for. They know they can and always will.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36111ba elementor-position-top elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"36111ba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"399\" height=\"418\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/wave.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1966\" alt=\"Wave Riders\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/wave.png 399w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/wave-286x300.png 286w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 399px) 100vw, 399px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Wave Riders<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">They know what they want. And they turn around failures and problems into new opportunities. Riding the waves, they architect the course of their destiny.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2af700f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2af700f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b0b462e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b0b462e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba51ae4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ba51ae4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Untitled-design-3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1818\" alt=\"Sports and Physical Education\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Untitled-design-3.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Untitled-design-3-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Untitled-design-3-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Untitled-design-3-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Untitled-design-3-768x768.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8f3318 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c8f3318\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64bb36c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"64bb36c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Sports and Physical <span><span>Education<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab13af5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab13af5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAt Jaipuria Schools, sports are more than just activities\u2014they\u2019re a way of life. From the precision of archery and shooting to the strategy of chess, the grace of horse riding, and the energy of swimming and athletics, every sport is encouraged with passion and purpose.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72751b9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"72751b9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;gradient&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6033c34 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"6033c34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_center   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Inter-School Competitions <span><span>and Achievements<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ab04b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9ab04b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tParticipation in inter-school competitions like Pinnacle and Crescendo provides students with platforms to excel in diverse areas, including academics, sports, and the arts. These events foster a spirit of healthy competition, teamwork, and camaraderie among students.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abe578e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"abe578e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f1604b e-con-full e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5f1604b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c3fa280 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c3fa280\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1709\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Celebrating-New-Possibilities.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4012\" alt=\"Celebrating New Possibilities\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Celebrating-New-Possibilities.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Celebrating-New-Possibilities-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Celebrating-New-Possibilities-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Celebrating-New-Possibilities-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Celebrating-New-Possibilities-1536x1